<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Bienvenido a Origami Bogotá 2026</title>
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet" />

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            padding: 32px 16px;
        }

        .card {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       HERO
    ──────────────────────────── */
        .hero {
            background-color: #2d2d2d;
            background-image: url('https://origamibogota.com/images/cover.png');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            padding: 48px 40px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .hero::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background-color: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.72);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hero-logo {
            width: 56px;
            height: 56px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
            display: block;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.4));
        }

        .hero-eyebrow {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #f5a623;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', Impact, sans-serif;
            font-size: 78px;
            line-height: 0.88;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .hero-title .accent {
            color: #f5a623;
        }

        .hero-year {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            letter-spacing: 10px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
            display: block;
            margin-top: 4px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hero-dates-bar {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f5a623;
            color: #1e1e1e;
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 18px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            padding: 8px 28px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        .hero-sub {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            margin-top: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       XV ANIVERSARIO STRIP
    ──────────────────────────── */
        .xv-strip {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f5a623 0%, #e8960a 100%);
            padding: 0;
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .xv-cell {
            display: table-cell;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .xv-cell.right {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .xv-roman {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 22px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            color: #1e1e1e;
        }

        .xv-tag {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.6);
            display: block;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }

        .xv-right-text {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.55);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       SECTIONS
    ──────────────────────────── */
        .section-light {
            background-color: #f7f4f0;
            padding: 40px 40px;
        }

        .section-dark {
            background-color: #2d2d2d;
            padding: 40px 40px;
        }

        .section-orange {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5a623 0%, #e07b0a 100%);
            padding: 36px 40px;
        }

        .section-welcome {
            background-color: #f7f4f0;
            padding: 40px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .label-dark {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #f5a623;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            display: block;
        }

        .label-light {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #a07828;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            display: block;
        }

        .label-orange {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.55);
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            display: block;
        }

        .heading-dark {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 46px;
            line-height: 0.95;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .heading-light {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 46px;
            line-height: 0.95;
            color: #1e1e1e;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .heading-orange {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 40px;
            line-height: 0.95;
            color: #1e1e1e;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .heading-welcome {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 42px;
            line-height: 0.95;
            color: #1e1e1e;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .body-dark {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .body-light {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555555;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .body-orange {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.7);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .body-welcome {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #555555;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       LOCATION
    ──────────────────────────── */
        .location-box {
            background-color: rgba(245, 166, 35, 0.1);
            border-left: 3px solid #f5a623;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .loc-name {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 17px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #f5a623;
            display: block;
        }

        .loc-addr {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3px;
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       BUTTONS
    ──────────────────────────── */
        .btn-orange {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f5a623;
            color: #1e1e1e !important;
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .btn-white {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #1e1e1e !important;
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .btn-ghost {
            display: inline-block;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 30px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        .btn-dark {
            display: inline-block;
            border: 2px solid #1e1e1e;
            color: #1e1e1e !important;
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 10px 30px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       GUESTS
    ──────────────────────────── */
        .guest-row {
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            padding-bottom: 24px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
        }

        .guest-row:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
            padding-bottom: 0;
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .guest-badge-cell {
            display: table-cell;
            width: 72px;
            vertical-align: top;
            padding-right: 16px;
            padding-top: 4px;
        }

        .guest-badge {
            background-color: #f5a623;
            color: #1e1e1e;
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            padding: 3px 6px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .guest-country {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
            display: block;
        }

        .guest-info-cell {
            display: table-cell;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        .guest-name {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 26px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: block;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .guest-bio {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       LINKS
    ──────────────────────────── */
        .link-row {
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(30, 30, 30, 0.1);
        }

        .link-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .link-icon {
            display: table-cell;
            width: 38px;
            vertical-align: middle;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .link-content {
            display: table-cell;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .link-title {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #1e1e1e;
            display: block;
        }

        .link-href {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #a07828;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .link-arrow {
            display: table-cell;
            width: 20px;
            vertical-align: middle;
            text-align: right;
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #f5a623;
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       SOCIAL
    ──────────────────────────── */
        .social-row {
            background-color: #242424;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 22px 40px;
        }

        .social-label {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 9px;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .social-icons {
            display: inline-table;
        }

        .social-icons td {
            padding: 0 8px;
        }

        .social-icons img {
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            opacity: 0.6;
            display: block;
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       FOOTER
    ──────────────────────────── */
        .footer {
            background-color: #151515;
            padding: 24px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer-brand {
            font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
            font-size: 18px;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            color: #f5a623;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .footer-copy {
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 300;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* ────────────────────────────
       RESPONSIVE
    ──────────────────────────── */
        @media (max-width: 620px) {
            .wrapper {
                padding: 0;
            }

            .card {
                border-radius: 0;
            }

            .hero {
                padding: 32px 20px 28px;
            }

            .hero-logo {
                width: 44px;
                height: 44px;
                margin-bottom: 14px;
            }

            .hero-eyebrow {
                font-size: 8px;
                letter-spacing: 3px;
            }

            .hero-title {
                font-size: 46px;
                letter-spacing: 2px;
            }

            .hero-year {
                font-size: 22px;
                letter-spacing: 6px;
            }

            .hero-dates-bar {
                font-size: 15px;
                letter-spacing: 3px;
                padding: 7px 20px;
                margin-top: 18px;
            }

            .hero-sub {
                font-size: 10px;
                letter-spacing: 1px;
                margin-top: 10px;
            }

            .section-light,
            .section-dark,
            .section-orange,
            .section-welcome {
                padding: 28px 20px;
            }

            .heading-dark,
            .heading-light,
            .heading-orange,
            .heading-welcome {
                font-size: 32px;
                letter-spacing: 1px;
                margin-bottom: 12px;
            }

            .body-dark,
            .body-light,
            .body-orange,
            .body-welcome {
                font-size: 13px;
                line-height: 1.7;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }

            .btn-orange,
            .btn-white,
            .btn-ghost,
            .btn-dark {
                font-size: 14px;
                letter-spacing: 2px;
                padding: 10px 22px;
                margin-left: 0;
                margin-top: 8px;
                display: inline-block;
            }

            .guest-name {
                font-size: 22px;
            }

            .guest-bio {
                font-size: 11px;
            }

            .link-title {
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .location-box {
                padding: 12px 14px;
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }

            .loc-name {
                font-size: 15px;
            }

            .loc-addr {
                font-size: 11px;
            }

            .xv-roman {
                font-size: 18px;
            }

            .xv-right-text {
                font-size: 9px;
            }

            .social-row,
            .footer {
                padding: 18px 20px;
            }

            .footer-brand {
                font-size: 15px;
                letter-spacing: 4px;
            }

            .footer-copy {
                font-size: 9px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <table class="card" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
            <tbody>

                <!-- HERO -->
                <tr>
                    <td class="hero">
                        <img class="hero-logo"
                            src="https://origamibogota.com/images/cropped-AP-2-qep957ie0pzbkwpdzf4c2r01boqxpvvlttrkjq3bvs.png"
                            alt="Amigos Plegadores" />
                        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Encuentro Internacional · Colombia</p>
                        <h1 class="hero-title">ORIGAMI<br><span class="accent">BOGOTÁ</span></h1>
                        <span class="hero-year">2 0 2 6</span>
                        <br />
                        <span class="hero-dates-bar">JUNIO 12 — 14</span>
                        <p class="hero-sub">El congreso de origami más importante de Latinoamérica</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- XV STRIP -->
                <tr>
                    <td>
                        <table class="xv-strip" role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                            <tr>
                                <td class="xv-cell">
                                    <span class="xv-roman">XV AÑOS</span>
                                    <span class="xv-tag">Plegando Juntos</span>
                                </td>
                                <td class="xv-cell right">
                                    <span class="xv-right-text">Amigos Plegadores · Bogotá</span>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- WELCOME -->
                <tr>
                    <td class="section-welcome">
                        <span class="label-light"></span>
                        <h2 class="heading-welcome">{{ name }},<br>TE DAMOS LA BIENVENIDA A<br>ORIGAMI BOGOTÁ</h2>
                        <p class="body-welcome">
                            Un lugar donde nos encontraremos para plegar y compartir experiencias un fin de semana
                            completo, con invitados internacionales, exposiciones y mucho más.
                        </p>
                        <p class="body-welcome">
                            ¡Pronto tendremos más noticias sobre el evento! Mientras tanto puedes ingresar a <a
                                href="https://origamibogota.com"
                                style="color:#a07828;text-decoration:underline;">origamibogota.com</a> y descubrir todas
                            las actividades que tenemos.
                        </p>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- ORANGE CTA - WHATSAPP + CALENDARIO -->
                <tr>
                    <td class="section-orange">
                        <span class="label-orange">· Únete ·</span>
                        <h2 class="heading-orange">ESTEMOS EN<br>CONTACTO</h2>
                        <p class="body-orange">Recibe anuncios, cambios de último momento y conecta con otras personas
                            asistentes antes del evento.</p>
                        <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/DPnXWxyk6Gr9iQVkhfHoLX" class="btn-white">💬 Unirse al grupo de WhatsApp</a>
                        <a href="https://calendar.app.google/M5feunNiYuXnfRZD7" class="btn-dark">📅 Guardar en el calendario</a>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- INTRO DARK -->
                <tr>
                    <td class="section-dark">
                        <span class="label-dark">· El Evento ·</span>
                        <h2 class="heading-dark">YA FALTA<br>MUY POCO</h2>
                        <p class="body-dark">
                            En pocas semanas nos reunimos de nuevo. Talleres para todos los niveles, exposición
                            colectiva, chocogami, intercambio de tarjetas ATC, origami de pasillo, artistas invitados y
                            mucho papel. Un fin de semana que no querrás perderte.
                        </p>

                        <div class="location-box">
                            <span class="loc-name">📍 Liceo Francés Louis Pasteur</span>
                            <span class="loc-addr">Cl. 87 #7-77 · Barrio La Cabrera · Bogotá, Colombia</span>
                        </div>

                        <a href="https://origamibogota.com/actividades" class="btn-orange">Ver Agenda</a>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- GUESTS LIGHT -->
                <tr>
                    <td class="section-light">
                        <span class="label-light">· Artistas Invitados 2026 ·</span>
                        <h2 class="heading-light">INVITADOS<br>ESPECIALES</h2>

                        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%"
                            style="margin-bottom:24px;padding-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #e0d8cc;">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="width:80px;vertical-align:top;padding-right:16px;padding-top:4px;">
                                    <span
                                        style="background:#f5a623;color:#1e1e1e;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;padding:3px 6px;display:inline-block;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:4px;">INTL.</span>
                                    <span
                                        style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:10px;color:#888;display:block;">Canadá
                                        🍁</span>
                                </td>
                                <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                                    <span
                                        style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#1e1e1e;display:block;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px;">Joseph
                                        Wu</span>
                                    <p
                                        style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;">
                                        Artista de Vancouver con más de 40 años de trayectoria. Ha expuesto en museos,
                                        colaborado con marcas internacionales y producciones audiovisuales. Reseñado por
                                        The New York Times.</p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>

                        <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
                            <tr>
                                <td style="width:80px;vertical-align:top;padding-right:16px;padding-top:4px;">
                                    <span
                                        style="background:#f5a623;color:#1e1e1e;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;padding:3px 6px;display:inline-block;border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:4px;">NAC.</span>
                                    <span
                                        style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:10px;color:#888;display:block;">Colombia
                                        🇨🇴</span>
                                </td>
                                <td style="vertical-align:top;">
                                    <span
                                        style="font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:26px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#1e1e1e;display:block;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px;">Diana
                                        M. Vargas</span>
                                    <p
                                        style="font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:300;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#666;">
                                        Diseñadora colombiana especializada en origami modular y geométrico. </p>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>

                <!-- LINKS LIGHT -->
